abstract: >-
  A local Python execution library separating immutable work from versioned
  acceptance, with dependency revalidation, bounded streaming, durable producer
  attempt accounting and an optional MCP interface. Its examples and benchmarks
  are deterministic software fixtures, not evidence of model learning.
